# Normalize everything git recognizes as text; a machine-global
# core.autocrlf must never decide what bytes land in the repo.
* text=auto
# The price store is append-only JSONL committed from both Windows (local
# runs) and Linux (CI). CRLF must never enter it: a single CRLF row makes
# `git diff` show the whole file as changed and breaks byte-level dedupe.
*.jsonl text eol=lf
